Third-party components in the shipped binaries
  * The Rust standard library (MIT OR Apache-2.0), linked into uz_translit_ffi.dll.
  * The Microsoft C runtime of the MSVC toolchain, linked statically into uz_translit_ffi.dll (crt-static), as
    redistributable toolchain runtime code; no separate Visual C++ redistributable is installed.
  * The add-in host uses the Microsoft .NET Framework 4.x that is part of Windows; nothing of it is shipped.

Build-time tools (not shipped): Rust/cargo, the MSVC linker and Roslyn C# compiler (Visual Studio or Build Tools),
the Windows SDK resource compiler, WiX Toolset 5.0.2 (MS-RL).

No code from Microsoft Office or from any GPL- or AGPL-licensed project is included; the Office object model is used
late-bound from its public documentation, and the two Office COM interfaces are declared from their public IIDs.
